# subagent-driven-development workspaces: per-plan scratch (ledger, task
# briefs, implementer reports, review packages). The skill treats these as
# git-ignored scratch, and a review package is a full -U10 diff, so they are
# large and duplicate what git already holds.
.superpowers/sdd/*/
